                                "sense_id": "4fd28f73-983d-38cd-b513-69f4004837ee",
                                "text": "Come, come, you are well understood to be a perfecter / giber for the table than a necessary bencher in the / Capitol."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "3d771b74-5fde-43f1-9465-b5a2b8685102",
                                "sense_id": "4fd28f73-983d-38cd-b513-69f4004837ee",
                                "text": "Come Sempronia , leave him;\nHe is a giber; and our present business\nIs of more serious consequence"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "82665743-0d16-4114-9555-9c0b3fdb1049",
                                "sense_id": "4fd28f73-983d-38cd-b513-69f4004837ee",
                                "text": "[…] here were no Gibers, Cenſurers, Backbiters, Pick-pockets, Highwaymen, Houſebreakers, Attorneys, Bawds, Buffoons, Gameſters, Politicians, Wits, ſplenetick tedious Talkers, Controvertiſts, Raviſhers, Murderers, Robbers, Virtuoſo's; […]"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "849a3a21-6981-4163-94d1-4ad374c26805",
                                "sense_id": "4fd28f73-983d-38cd-b513-69f4004837ee",
                                "text": "Aloof you stand and hear the railer's gibe / While rain their shafts on me the giber-band."
                            }
                        ]
